    "long_instructions": "## Set Your Status\r\n\r\n1. Create a function called `setStatus` that takes in one parameter.\r\n2. Use conditionals to check if the value of the parameter is set to \"online\" or \"offline\" and set the message accordingly.\r\n3. Display the message on screen.\r\n\r\n_Challenge: Update the JavaScript and CSS code to display an \"online\" status differently from an \"offline\" status._",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Code a function that takes in a parameter to set an online/offline status.",
